module test.modules.Inherits where

import test.modules.Opener

-- **A bare `off` and no `open` of its own, and it is REFUSED** — his ruling of
-- 2026-11-06. The `open Bit` is `Opener`'s and stays there: an `open` says how
-- a name is written where the reader stands, so nothing invisible in this file
-- can change what a word in it means. `Thena.Driver.openedFrom` says why.
b : Bit.Bit
b = off
